                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='8212' id='104' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49434' x='50000' y='1060'>
                <zone h='8212' id='36' name='Executive Sheet' param='[federated.1lu9i861m2kujv1fh20081u857x7].[none:created_date:qk]' show-null-ctrls='false' show-reldate-picker='false' type-v2='filter' values='database' w='16478' x='50000' y='1060'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='8212' id='144' mode='checkdropdown' name='Executive Sheet' param='[federated.1lu9i861m2kujv1fh20081u857x7].[none:management_entity:nk]' type-v2='filter' values='cascading' w='16478' x='66478' y='1060'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='8212' id='103' name='Documentation Link' show-title='false' w='16478' x='82956' y='1060'>
                  <layout-cache fixed-size-h='50' fixed-size-w='272' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='663' h='64105' id='17' is-fixed='true' name='Executive Sheet' show-title='false' w='98868' x='566' y='9272'>
              <layout-cache type-h='fixed' type-w='cell' />
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='185' forceUpdate='true' h='25563' id='147' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98868' x='566' y='73377'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontsize='11'>Readiness Score is a combination of three elements.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Data Availability (DA)</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>: %10 score is granted to an entity for each if vouchers or discounts are tracked. %5 score is granted to an entity for each if Delivery Free or Item Incentives are tracked.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Value Accuracy (VA)</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>: Checks the total amounts in Orders (ORD) and Customer Incentive Transactions (CIT) streams. Percentages are calculated based on the matching orders and the amount of orders in ORD stream. (Matched / ORD)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Data Validity (DV)</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>: There are 8 validity checks on an incentivised order from ORD stream. If an order passes all, then we count them as valid. Percentages are calculated based on the valid orders and the amount of orders in ORD stream. (Valid / ORD). The details of these 8 checks can be found in </run>
                <run fontsize='11' italic='true'>Time-Series </run>
                <run fontsize='11'>tab.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Readiness Score (RS)</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>: Sum of DA Scores + (0.7 * VA * DV)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>* Wallet Incentives are not used for calculating the score of an entity because they are produced by a central team. </run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
